completed_at: "2026-09-06T06:16:23.822Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
resolution: "Gave the Audit release completeness step env GH_TOKEN with github.token, matching the two steps above it in the same workflow that also shell out to gh."
expected_result: The audit runs after the GitHub Release is created and reports whether every release tag has a published npm version and a GitHub Release.
actual_result: "Its gh calls aborted for want of a token, so the script exited 1 before auditing anything and the release job reported failure on eight consecutive runs while publishing successfully, hiding two genuine failures in the noise."
